  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNDP: St&#xf6;d till Parlamentet/Grundlagsf&#xf6;rsamlingen</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP: Support to Parliament/Const. Assembly</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to citizen&apos;s especially the youth in democratic transition and strengthening the transparent political processes of political representation and inclusive dialogue respecting gender equality</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta program genomf&#xf6;rs av UNDP och syftar till att ge tekniskt och   logistiskt st&#xf6;d till den konstituerande f&#xf6;rsamlingens arbete b&#xe5;de som f&#xf6;rfattare av en ny konstitution och som parlament. Programmet        inneh&#xe5;ller ocks&#xe5; komponenter syftande till att st&#xe4;rka relationen      mellan f&#xf6;rsamlingen och befolkningen, samt till att erbjuda           internationella erfarenheter.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This program, performed by UNDP aims to provide technical and         logistical support to the Constituent Assembly both in its function   as writer of the new Tunisian constitution, and as parliament. The    program also contains components aimed at enhancing relations between the assembly and the general public, as well as providing information on international best practice and experience.</narrative>
  </description>
